1059→\centering
1060→\caption{Bottleneck comparison: connectivity preservation under flux-based vs.\ probability-only pruning.}
1061→\label{tab:comparison_bottleneck}
1062→\begin{tabular}{lcc}
1063→\hline
1064→Metric & Adaptive FSP & Krylov-FSP-SSA \\
1065→\hline
1066→Wall time (s) & 2{,}558 & 0.3 \\
1067→Snapshots / Iterations & 100{,}000 & 500 \\
1068→Time reached & $10^5$ (complete) & $10^5$ (complete) \\
1069→Final $\langle C \rangle$ & 357 & 18.7 \\

